    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>LR Portfolio &amp; Gallery is an amazing and powerful WordPress portfolio plugin designed to help you display your portfolio projects.</p>\n<p>You can quickly add portfolio to your portfolio(s), display them anywhere with a easy shortcode.<br />\nit&#8217;s totally free.</p>\n<p>For more features Please contact us at <a href=\"https://www.logicrays.com/contact-us.php\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Logicrays</a><br />\nIf you like this plugin Please rate us 🙂</p>\n<h3>Plugin Features</h3>\n<p>Responsive Portfolio plugin<br />\nAll modren browser support<br />\nworks with anytype of theme<br />\nEasy to customize for developeres<br />\nEasy to configure</p>\n<h3>Shortcode</h3>\n<p><code>[LRPORTFOLIOS]</code></p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"a%20question%20that%20someone%20might%20have\">\nA question that someone might have\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>An answer to that question.</p>\n</p>\n\n"
